            "COMPOSER_LINK_COMPOSER",
            "COMPOSER_LINK_JQ",
            "COMPOSER_LINK_PHP"
        ]
    },
    "about": "A sample, not a machine record: copy this file to .agents/machine.local.json — the name .gitignore holds — and replace every __TOKEN__ with this machine's own value. The tokens are the facts that differ between two machines: the interpreter and its directory (__PHP_EXE__, __PHP_DIR__), PowerShell (__PWSH_EXE__), this checkout (__PACKAGE_DIR__), the commit it is on (__HEAD__), the composer program (__COMPOSER_PHAR__), ripgrep (__RG_EXE__), the psql client directory (__PSQL_DIR__) and the signing key git commits with (__GIT_SIGNING_KEY__). The rows that are the same on every machine of this kind — the versions, the origin URL, the checks and the tarball rows — are meant to be read and left alone. bin/interpreter.php reads php.exe out of the real record and skips the whole file when it is absent, so a clone without one runs on whatever php the shell has; tests/Unit/Docs/HandoffTest.php compares HANDOFF.md's environment table with the real record and skips the comparison here for the same reason."
}
